[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:Stop Thief!]
[00:14.12]How did Roy stop the thieves?
[00:19.35]Roy Trenton used to drive a taxi.
[00:23.76]A short while ago, however, he became a bus driver and he has not regretted it.
[00:31.87]He is finding his new work far more exciting.
[00:37.37]When he was driving along Catford Street recently, he saw two thieves rush out of a shop and run towards a waiting car.
[00:49.87]One of them was carrying a bag full of money.
[00:54.84]Roy acted quickly and drove the bus straight at the thieves.
[01:00.68]The one with the money got such a fright that he dropped the bag.
[01:07.47]As the thieves were trying to get away in their car, Roy drove his bus into the back of it.
[01:16.07]While the battered car was moving away, Roy stopped his bus and telephoned the police.
[01:24.81]The thieves'car was badly damaged and easy to recognize.
[01:31.24]Shortly afterwards, the police stopped the car and both men were arrested.
